msgid "Kantin & dompet"
msgstr "Canteen & wallet"

#: apps/marketing/views.py:15
msgid ""
"Dompet siswa non-tunai, batas belanja harian, dan POS kantin yang tetap "
"jalan saat jaringan mati."
msgstr "Cashless student wallets, daily spending limits, and a canteen POS that keeps running when the network is down."

