#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:4
msgid "Partner & Vendor API — EduCore"
msgstr "Partner & Vendor API — EduCore"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:8
msgid "Integrasi mitra & vendor"
msgstr "Partner & vendor integration"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:9
msgid "Satu API untuk seluruh sistem operasi sekolah."
msgstr "One API for the whole school operating system."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:10
msgid ""
"Baca data siswa, tagihan, kehadiran, dan penggajian dari EduCore — atau "
"kirim hasil proses Anda kembali. REST, versi di path, kunci per yayasan, dan "
"kontrak error yang stabil."
msgstr "Read student, billing, attendance, and payroll data from EduCore — or send your processing results back. REST, path-based versioning, per-foundation keys, and a stable error contract."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:12
msgid "Kunci sandbox Partner API"
msgstr "Partner API sandbox key"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:12
msgid "Buat akun sandbox"
msgstr "Create a sandbox account"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:18
msgid ""
"Kunci berawalan <code>ak_test_</code> selalu menabrak data sintetis dan "
"tidak pernah mengirim notifikasi ke orang tua. Gunakan itu untuk seluruh "
"pengembangan."
msgstr "Keys prefixed <code>ak_test_</code> always hit synthetic data and never send notifications to parents. Use it for all development."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:23
msgid "Referensi"
msgstr "Reference"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:26
#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:41
