#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:57
msgid "Konvensi"
msgstr "Conventions"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:30
#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:87
msgid "Webhook & polling"
msgstr "Webhooks & polling"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:32
#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:112
msgid "Batas laju"
msgstr "Rate limits"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:42
msgid ""
"Setiap permintaan membawa key-id di header dan tanda tangan HMAC-SHA256 atas "
"<code>timestamp + method + path + body</code>. Secret tidak pernah dikirim. "
"Permintaan dengan timestamp lebih dari 300 detik ditolak."
msgstr "Every request carries a key-id header and an HMAC-SHA256 signature over <code>timestamp + method + path + body</code>. The secret is never sent. Requests with a timestamp older than 300 seconds are rejected."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:48
#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:59
msgid "Aturan"
msgstr "Rule"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:48
msgid "Ketentuan"
msgstr "Terms"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:49
msgid "Cakupan"
msgstr "Scope"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:49
msgid ""
"Ditetapkan yayasan, per domain dan per sekolah. Tidak bisa diperluas oleh "
"mitra."
msgstr "Set by the foundation, per domain and per school. Cannot be widened by the partner."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:50
msgid "Rotasi"
msgstr "Rotation"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:50
msgid ""
"Dua kunci aktif maksimal 30 hari. Kunci lama jadi read-only saat hari ke-23."
msgstr "At most two active keys for 30 days. The old key becomes read-only on day 23."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:51
msgid "Opsional per kunci, wajib untuk cakupan <code>payroll.write</code>."
msgstr "Optional per key, required for the <code>payroll.write</code> scope."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:55
msgid ""
"Versi ada di path, bukan header. Perubahan yang memutus kontrak selalu "
"menjadi <code>/api/v2/</code> baru; penambahan field opsional bukan "
"perubahan yang memutus. Versi lama hidup 12 bulan setelah pengganti keluar, "
"dan mengirim header <code>Sunset</code> sejak hari pertama."
msgstr "The version lives in the path, not a header. Breaking changes always become a new <code>/api/v2/</code>; adding an optional field is not a breaking change. An old version lives for 12 months after its replacement ships, and sends a <code>Sunset</code> header from day one."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:59
msgid "Bentuk"
msgstr "Shape"

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:60
msgid "Paginasi"
msgstr "Pagination"

