#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:65
msgid ""
"Format uang adalah string dengan mata uang di level objek yang sama. Jangan "
"pernah menjumlahkan lintas mata uang: endpoint agregat mengembalikan array "
"total per mata uang, bukan satu angka."
msgstr "Money is a string with the currency at the same object level. Never sum across currencies: aggregate endpoints return an array of totals per currency, not a single number."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:68
msgid ""
"Semua error adalah RFC 9457 <code>application/problem+json</code>. Cabangkan "
"logika pada <code>code</code> — string SCREAMING_SNAKE yang stabil — bukan "
"pada prosa <code>detail</code>."
msgstr "All errors are RFC 9457 <code>application/problem+json</code>. Branch your logic on <code>code</code> — a stable SCREAMING_SNAKE string — not on the <code>detail</code> prose."

#: frontend/templates/marketing/partner_api.html:88
msgid ""
"Webhook adalah jalur utama. Daftarkan satu endpoint HTTPS per lingkungan, "
"terima POST bertanda tangan sama seperti permintaan keluar, dan balas 2xx "
"dalam 5 detik. Kegagalan dicoba ulang lima kali dengan jeda eksponensial "
"hingga 6 jam; setelah itu kejadian tetap tersedia lewat polling."
msgstr "Webhooks are the primary path. Register one HTTPS endpoint per environment, accept a POST signed the same way as outgoing requests, and reply 2xx within 5 seconds. Failures are retried five times with exponential backoff up to 6 hours; after that, the event stays available via polling."

